simple-ldapd is a lightweight LDAPv3 directory daemon for SSO via LDAP bind.

It ships an OpenLDAP-style CLI. Default tool names match OpenLDAP
(ldapsearch, ldapadd, …). Rebuild with -DLDAP_CLI_PREFIX=simple- if
OpenLDAP clients must remain on PATH.

WWW: https://github.com/SimpleDaemons/simple-ldapd
